# Project Praxis
#
# This is a distribution repo: what is committed here is what a player installs.
# Nothing that only exists to BUILD a modlet belongs in it. The modlet sources
# live in https://github.com/SphereII/SphereII.Mods and are mirrored in.
#
# This list matches the exclusions in the pack updater script
# (Mods/UpdateModsFromRepo.bat: /XD obj bin .vs .git /XF *.user *.suo), so a
# folder skipped on deployment is also a folder that never reaches git.
#
# Note on DLLs: a modlet's assembly is committed, but only at the modlet root,
# because that is the only place 7 Days to Die loads one from. Copies under
# bin/ and obj/ are build artifacts the game never reads.

# Build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/

# Visual Studio / Rider local state
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.cache

# Packaging
*.zip
*.7z

# OS litter
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
